  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br />Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cost</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is the constant of integration.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>lnx</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>.&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</p>",
